{"duration": 54.185, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A signalman waved a giant flag from a rickety bridge, arms trembling.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.924}, {"beat": 1, "text": "His fellow engineers snorted, saying the ordinary semaphore arm would suffice.", "start": 4.344, "end": 8.711}, {"beat": 1, "text": "They claimed a flag was old\u2011fashioned and useless.", "start": 8.931, "end": 11.511}, {"beat": 2, "text": "A freight train roared toward the river, driver squinting at the arm.", "start": 11.931, "end": 15.235}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Thick fog rolled in, hiding the semaphore like a ghost.", "start": 15.455, "end": 18.449}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The driver could not tell if the line was clear.", "start": 18.669, "end": 20.833}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like reading a street sign through a rain\u2011soaked windshield.", "start": 21.253, "end": 24.75}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Wigwag uses one flag swung side\u2011to\u2011side, visible farther than a static arm.", "start": 25.17, "end": 29.788}, {"beat": 4, "text": "From the bridge the driver\u2019s eye meets the flag, not the arm.", "start": 30.008, "end": 33.129}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The flag stays visible even when fog or smoke blocks the semaphore.", "start": 33.349, "end": 37.25}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Bridges often limited the height of semaphore arms, forcing a lower placement.", "start": 37.47, "end": 41.524}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Ironically, the same flag later retired, becoming a museum relic.", "start": 41.944, "end": 45.744}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Modern colour\u2011light signals never needed a hand\u2011held flag.", "start": 45.964, "end": 49.247}, {"beat": 5, "text": "When electric lights arrived, the flag finally faded into history.", "start": 49.467, "end": 53.065}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "signalman", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.72, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "waved", "start": 0.77, "end": 1.02, "line": 0, "b